 WELL CELEBRATION! EVERYTHING MUST GO!\n\n📅 Saturday\, October 31\, 2026
  ⏰ 10:00 AM – 4:00 PM 📍 LaDells Shoes | 301 Georgia Street\, Suite 
 100\, Downtown Vallejo\n\n🎉 OUR BIGGEST SALE EVER!\n\n👠 ALL WOMEN'S 
 SHOES — $5 PER PAIR!\n\n👞 MEN'S SHOES — $40 OR 2 FOR $70!\n\n👜 P
 URSES — $5 EACH!\n\n💍 JEWELRY — $1 EACH!\n\n🕶️ SUNGLASSES\, AC
 CESSORIES\, CROC CHARMS & MORE!\n\nEverything must go! This is your last o
 pportunity to shop LaDells Shoes and take home some incredible deals. All 
 sales are final\, and merchandise is available while supplies last.For 20 
 years\, LaDells Shoes has been more than a business. It's been a place of 
 community\, connection\, entrepreneurship\, and countless memories.\n\nOct
 ober 31 is especially meaningful because it marks 17 years since we opened
  our Georgia Street storefront in 2009.
