BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Frightful Fling IV: 2 Rooms of Scintillating Halloween Fun - Downt
 own SR
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T013000
UID:261027yaRcFsZBukCbGv7LYhgIew
DESCRIPTION:FRIGHTFUL FLING IV\n\n2 Rooms of Scintillating Halloween Fun!\
 n\nSaturday\, October 31\, 2026 | 7 PM – Late Barrel Proof Lounge | Down
 town Santa Rosa\n\nFour years of Halloween mischief\, and we're just getti
 ng warmed up.\n\nFrightful Fling returns for its 4th annual Halloween cele
 bration\, taking over Barrel Proof Lounge with two rooms of music\, outrag
 eous costumes\, dancing\, strange discoveries\, and some wonderfully quest
 ionable activities.\n\nWe're bringing back the infamous Jello Shot Gauntle
 t\, hosting a costume contest with five prize categories\, and adding a br
 and-new photo scavenger hunt to the festivities.\n\nThrow in tarot reading
 s\, drink specials\, and a building full of people dressed like absolute l
 unatics\, and we've got ourselves a Halloween party.\n\nThe fun starts at 
 7 PM\, and we're going LATE!\n\nTWO ROOMS. TWO DIFFERENT SOUNDS.\n\nTHE LO
 UNGE 90s & 2000s Hip-Hop • R&B • Throwback Jams\n\nOld-school favorite
 s\, forgotten bangers\, and all those songs you still know every word to.\
 n\nTHE MAIN ROOM EDM • Drum & Bass\n\nHeavy bass\, electronic beats\, an
 d a dance floor that doesn't know when to quit.\n\nBounce between rooms\, 
 change up your soundtrack\, and find your people.\n\nHALLOWEEN COSTUME CON
 TEST | 10 PM\n\nHalloween costumes are serious business around here. Well\
 , some of them are.\n\nWe're handing out prizes in five categories this ye
 ar!\n\nBEST COUPLE – Double the creativity\, double the trouble.\n\nSEXI
 EST – You know who you are.\n\nWEIRDEST – The more bizarre\, the bette
 r.\n\nSCARIEST – Give us nightmares.\n\nFUNNIEST – Make us laugh. Bonu
 s points if we can't stop.\n\nCostume judging takes place at 10 PM!\n\nNEW
 ! THE FRIGHTFUL PHOTO SCAVENGER HUNT\n\nWe've hidden a little Halloween mi
 schief throughout Barrel Proof\, and we're challenging you to find it.\n\n
 Grab your phone\, follow the clues\, and track down a collection of object
 s\, oddities\, and surprises scattered around the building.\n\nFind the it
 ems. Photograph the evidence. Report back and claim your prize!\n\nSome th
 ings will be easy to spot. Others might have you questioning how well you 
 really know this place.\n\nKeep your eyes open. You never know what's lurk
 ing around the corner.\n\nTAROT READINGS WITH RIVER | 7–9 PM\n\nWant a l
 ittle glimpse into the unknown?\n\nRiver joins us for special Halloween ta
 rot readings from 7–9 PM.\n\nAn established Tarot\, Oracle\, and Charm r
 eader\, River is also an incredibly talented artist and stand-up comedian 
 who has performed right here on the Barrel Proof stage.\n\nShe's bringing 
 her cards\, her intuition\, and her own unique brand of magic to Frightful
  Fling.\n\nStop by for a reading and see what the universe has to say.\n\n
 THE JELLO SHOT GAUNTLET RETURNS!\n\nThree levels. Mystery flavors. Questio
 nable dignity.\n\nOur ridiculous Jello Shot Gauntlet is back for another r
 ound of Halloween nonsense!\n\nTake on a three-level tasting challenge fea
 turing mystery flavors\, hands-free slurping\, and glow-in-the-dark surpri
 ses.\n\nComplete the gauntlet and earn a prize… or at least some highly 
 questionable bragging rights.\n\nYour friends are absolutely going to take
  pictures.\n\nHALLOWEEN DRINK SPECIALS\n\n$6 Modelos Jello Shots All Night
  Long!\n\nPlus our regular selection of beer\, wine\, Soju cocktails\, and
  mocktails.\n\nJOIN THE MADNESS!\n\nStart your Halloween night with some l
 aughs\, then stick around as Barrel Proof transforms into a two-room dance
  party.\n\nThere's plenty happening throughout the evening\, so come early
 \, explore the building\, enter the contest\, and make a whole night of it
 .\n\nTickets are available now! Reserve your spot and join us for Frightfu
 l Fling IV!\n\nBARREL PROOF LOUNGE 501 Mendocino Avenue Downtown Santa Ros
 a\, CA\n\nSaturday\, October 31\, 2026 7 PM – Late 21+ Only\n\nCome dres
 sed to impress\, disturb\, confuse\, or amuse. Just don't come boring.\n\n
 Check out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://FrightfulFling4.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
