DESCRIPTION:The Halloween Series\n\nWe’ve been toiling away in our secre
 t laboratory \\(“kitchen”\\)\, and we’re ready to reveal five Hallow
 een ice cream flavors that will chill you to your bones. Skip the doorbell
 s and ring in the season with a heaping scoop of an irresistible candy-fil
 led classic. Dare to indulge in a green tea swirl of crispy\, crunchy\, ed
 ible creatures. Or pluck up your courage for a ghostly encounter with our 
 most confounding flavor. With this many temptations abound\, you’re sure
  to find a treat you’ll seek all October long.
