SUMMARY:Flynn Creek Circus - The Cricket and the Wren
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T150000
UID:261019aO_5XguEuk6JiYdQog1rNA
DESCRIPTION:Flynn Creek Circus Presents ‘The Cricket & the Wren’: a hi
 ghly original\, all-human circus that enchants through breathtaking acroba
 tics and athletically stunning skill. Sponsored by the good folks at Sebas
 topol Grange.\n\nSebastopol\, CA— Oct 29 - Nov 1– This 2026 season\, F
 lynn Creek Circus invites audiences to ‘The Cricket & the Wren’ — me
 morable family fun and Artful athleticism under the circus big top.\n\nA m
 erchant’s daughter sets out to find the castle where the horizon meets t
 he sea. In order to  break the spell of the Frog Prince\, she must brave 
 a harrowing journey filled with wonder.\n\nAlong the adventure\, she encou
 nters Jack and the Beanstalk’s sassy cow\, an out of pocket Pirate and t
 he secret sacrifice of the cricket and the wren. \n\nFeaturing aerialists
 \, jugglers\, knife throwers\, and laugh out loud comedy\, this circus ble
 nds classic storybook archetypes with imaginative new heroes. The Cricket 
 and the Wren will surprise\, dazzle and delight all ages. \n\nIn addition
  to the family friendly showings\,  and the interactive children's camp p
 rogram held under the circus big top\,  Flynn Creek Circus also presents 
 the wildly popular 'Adults Only Show' boasting outrageous acts\, dark come
 dy\, and an infamous party atmosphere. Check the website for select adults
  only showtimes as well as special discount nights.\n\nSpectators for all 
 showings are invited to the tent to experience the magic up to 30 minutes 
 before each show. The event will offer beer\, wine\, and light concession 
 for purchase and include a 15 minute intermission during the two hour show
 .\n\nShowtimes:\n\nThursday\, Oct 29\n\n7:00 PM Show \\(Family Special\, a
 ll reservations %10 off\\)\n\nFriday\, Oct 30\n\n7 PM Show \\(Adults Only 
 21\\+\\)\n\nSaturday\, Oct 31\n\n3:00 PM Show – \\(Halloween extravaganz
 a\\)\n\n8:00 PM Show \\(Adults Only 21\\+\\)\n\nSunday\, Nov 1\n\n1:00 PM 
 Show \\(Day of the Dead special $10 off table reservations\\)\n\n5:00 PM S
 how
LOCATION:SEBASTOPOL GRANGE
URL:https://flynncreekcircus.com/tickets-page-2026/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
