DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T130000
UID:260930Xma2vwbBV0yEkJBz5Sml1w
DESCRIPTION:There are many wonderful California native shrubs and perennia
 ls that make perfect additions to existing gardens and are great replaceme
 nts for non-native plants. And because they are native to this climate\, t
 hey are better able to withstand the swings in rainfall and temperature we
  are seeing more frequently.\n\nMaster Gardener Linda King will discuss so
 me reasons for adding California native plants to your garden\, and recomm
 end a variety of native plants that are easy to care for and make great ad
 ditions to any existing garden. Join us under the shade of the trees at Pe
 taluma Bounty Unity Garden. There will be a period for answering all your 
 questions.
