DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T190000
UID:260906S_WaXchV8kGXA17l8ijz7g
DESCRIPTION:For people who like to party...but want to be home at a reason
 able hour...\n\nThe Hutchinsons: Seasoned Americana - Every 1st Tuesday! C
 oming from the tradition of folk music\, Kevin Hutchinson is a musical sto
 ryteller. His influences and styles cover many genres: folk\, folk rock\, 
 blues\, rock\, rockabilly\, Americana\, country\, swing\, and\, of course\
 , folk. His music is lyric driven\, and spans topics from love to social c
 ommentary\, serious to light hearted.\n\nKevin loves connecting with the a
 udience with his originals and thoughtful covers of artists that have insp
 ired him\, often pulling from their lesser known material.\n\nArtistic inf
 luences\, covering decades\, include: John Prine\; Bob Dylan\; Bruce Cockb
 urn\; Warren Zevon\; Crosby\, Stills and Nash\; Peter\, Paul and Mary\; Ro
 bert Earl Keen\; Tom Russel\; Tom Paxton\; Paul Thorne\; and many more.\n\
 n21+ Happy Hour Pricing 4-7pm All beers - $6 + $2 off wine. Live Music 5-7
 pm 2 drink minimum\, please\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for
  all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/live-music-happy-hour-the-hutchinsons-son
 oma-seasoned-americana-tickets-1336190193839?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T170000
UID:260824jQrM7Gx2DU-gAszE6t25IQ
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\nMaple Magic & Winter Wonder invites vis
 itors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativity\
 , and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided walks\,
  hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by the c
 hanging landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the swee
 t fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experience th
 e peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
