 on\n\nRoom 109\, Rotary Kitchen\n\nCategory\n\nCulinary Arts\n\nExperience
  Level\n\nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$50\
 n\nMaterials Fee:\n\nIncluded\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$50\n\nJoin i
 nstructor Gerardo Diaz for a flavorful cooking demonstration centered on t
 he empanada. You’ll watch each step come together\, from mixing and roll
 ing the dough to preparing savory fillings and folding the signature crimp
 ed edge. Gerardo will share the techniques and tips that make these golden
  pockets a favorite across so many kitchens\, with plenty to taste along t
 he way. Whether you’re a curious foodie or hoping to recreate them at ho
 me\, you’ll leave inspired and ready to try your hand. Sign up today and
  bring your appetite to the Sonoma Community Center.
