 y – Milo Baker Chapter\, and Sonoma County Ag \\+ Open Space for this in
 teractive trivia event that has something for everyone. Join rounds of fri
 endly competition\, test your knowledge\, and discover fascinating facts a
 bout the native plants that support local wildlife and resilient landscape
 s. You can come solo or bring a team and enjoy the chance to connect with 
