UID:261031Dx9H7leZMkCdIK_YHJpGGw
DESCRIPTION:Stanroy Music Center Presents Song Service\, an intimate eveni
 ng with three artists passing the spotlight. Expect insights into the craf
 t of the song from inspiration to final form.
LOCATION:Lost Church Santa Rosa
