DESCRIPTION:First Fridays Salsa series\, don’t miss out! Get ready to ge
 t loose and move your body at our First Fridays Salsa Party under the star
 s!  At 7pm\, we’re serving up a sizzling dance class featuring Salsa\, M
 erengue\, Dancehall\, Afrobeats\, and more—it’s like a dance buffet fo
 r your feet!  Open dancing begins at 6pm and follows the dance lesson unti
 l 9pm.  Brace yourself for double the DJ magic with DJ Jay Fresco and B\\_
