DESCRIPTION:Join us for a wild night of karaoke and fun after the comedy s
 how every Friday - it's the ultimate party!\n\n Karaoke After Comedy – 
 Every Friday at 10PM!  Barrel Proof Lounge | Santa Rosa\n\nAfter the laug
 hs\, it’s time to grab the mic. Introducing Friday Late Night Karaoke 
 — your new weekly ritual for letting loose\, singing loud\, and kicking 
 off the weekend with style.\n\n What to expect: - Karaoke starts at 10PM
  – and goes late - Jell-O shots & rotating drink specials - Free popco
