 n - Perfect way to keep the party going after our stand-up shows\n\nWheth
 er you’re a karaoke superstar or just vibin’ with friends\, this is wh
 ere Santa Rosa comes to sing their face off every Friday night.\n\nCheck o
 ut **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead! 21+
