BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Joni Mitchell Situation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T203000
UID:261025otiwTrshQkqw0up3PP0ynA
DESCRIPTION:Follow the blustery autumn breeze into Furthermore Wine and Mu
 sic Lounge on Sat.\, Nov. 7\, 5:30-8:30 for a well-earned post-election ki
 ckback AND the Situation's Joni Mitchell birthday concert!\n\nThe Joni Mit
 chell Situation (Kate Foley-Beining\, vocals\, guitar\, piano\, dulcimer\;
  Tom Shader\, bass\; Kevin Dillon\, drums\; and Christian Foley-Beining\, 
 guitar) will warm you up with a collection of Joni's most beloved inclemen
 t weather songs: Rainy Night House\, Hunter\, Urge for Going\, Blue Motel 
 Room\, Hejira\, River\, and more.\n\nWe'll have balloons!\n\nEnjoy a free 
 three hour concert while you bask in Furthermore's cool urban vibe and sav
