BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Planting Day at SRJC Petaluma Campus
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T140000
UID:260922e2Nw9kIyDEK83kbqPGYC3g
DESCRIPTION:Join our Planting Day -- help us build a thriving meadow habit
 at at Santa Rosa Junior College - Petaluma Campus\n\nDaily Acts and Santa 
 Rosa Junior College are teaming up to transform the underutilized lawn thr
 oughout the school! This summer\, we sheet mulched 4 sections of lawn and 
 created a rain garden to help catch all our winter rain. This fall is the 
 right time to get native & climate-appropriate plantings in the ground bef
 ore our winter season arrives!\n\nTogether\, we’ll create a water-wise l
 andscape that will build habitat and bring beauty to the school community 
 for years to come.\n\nNOTE: All are welcome \\(including children with adu
