 icious food\, and award-winning wines at Kunde Family Winery. Held in the 
 Magnolia Room\, this relaxed event pairs beautiful vineyard views with gre
 at local entertainment and a featured food truck. On July 11\, enjoy live 
 performances by John Waltz and Christina Lovett while savoring fresh seafo
 od from Nellie's Oysters. Sip your favorite Kunde wines by the glass or bo
