 your toes\, lean in\, and feel the beat. Marcus Roberts Trio joins New Cen
 tury to bring fresh life to the music of Gerswhin and Ellington with strik
 ing cohesion. Music from two of today's leading women composers serves as 
 interludes\, each bringing their own unique sense of curiosity\, reflectio
 n\, and contrast. Together\, the music flows between the musicians and aud
 ience\, creating an irresistible surge of momentum and energy. Get ready t
 o groove!
