BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:BellyDancing with Carem
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T190000
UID:261012SFCHMdW0k0Onn2TDjTVqnQ
DESCRIPTION:Bellydancing for Beginners \n\nDiscover the beauty of Raqs Sh
 arqi \\(bellydance\\). This beginner-friendly class introduces you to fou
 ndational bellydance technique\, including hip movements\, isolations\, un
 dulations\, traveling steps\, combinations and musicality. You’ll develo
 p coordination\, body awareness\, strength\, and confidence while learning
  to move with greater ease and expression.\n\nNo previous dance experience
  is required. All bodies and experience levels are welcome.\n\nCome move t
 o the music\, connect with your body\, and discover the joy of bellydancin
 g\n\nCAREM LOVE\n\nCarem Love is a wellness advocate\, professional dancer
 \, and certified yoga instructor with a Bachelor’s degree in Dance. She 
 has extensive training in Bellydance\, a deep passion for Latin dance\, an
 d is certified in Hatha\, Vinyasa\, and Children’s Yoga.\n\nBelly dance 
 has profoundly supported her health\, well-being\, and dance career\, insp
 iring her to help others experience the same body-mind benefits. In her cl
 asses\, students learn to connect more deeply with themselves.\n\nDATE: Mo
 nday\n\nTIME: 6:00 PM\n\nWHERE: Salsa Dance Marin\, 4140 Redwood Hwy 8\, S
 an Rafael
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/belly-dancing-with-carem/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T170000
UID:260824nejoK9jnmUmXPaDdGToACQ
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\nMaple Magic & Winter Wonder invites vis
 itors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativity\
 , and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided walks\,
  hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by the c
 hanging landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the swee
 t fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experience th
 e peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Moms Supporting Moms: Single Mom & Default Parent Support Circle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T203000
UID:260803ajI3MiH2Y0uNVP_rIJF10A
DESCRIPTION:Single moms—and moms carrying most of the parenting load—a
 re invited to a cozy\, judgment-free evening at Shimmery Alchemy Studio in
  Santa Rosa.\n\nCome exactly as you are\, sip warm tea\, and connect with 
 women who understand the exhaustion\, overwhelm\, and isolation that can c
 ome with carrying the parenting load largely alone. We’ll have honest co
 nversations about default parenting\, solo parenting\, mom burnout\, and f
 inding genuine community.\n\nSweatpants and late arrivals are welcome. Spa
 ce is limited to keep the circle comfortable and intimate.\n\n**Thursday\,
  August 13 | 7:30–8:30 PM** **Shimmery Alchemy Studio | Santa Rosa** **$
 20 per person | Advance registration required**
LOCATION:Shimmery Alchemy
URL:http://www.tngmassage.com/events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Salsa Beginners 2 - Mondays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T190000
UID:260427614Oq_nKckGuYVE3X8i55w
DESCRIPTION:Ready to take your salsa to the next level? Salsa lessons in M
 arin will help you to add some flair and fluidity to your salsa dancing.\n
 \nPre-requisite: Salsa Beginners 1 – You know your basic steps\, left tu
 rn\, right turn\, cross-body lead\, and you hold your frame.\n\nWhat You
 ’ll Learn\n\nWe’ve curated a curriculum designed to build your confide
 nce and your “social dance” vocabulary:\n\n• The Cross Body Lead \\(
 CBL\\) Series: Master both Inside and Outside Turns\, the essential buildi
 ng blocks for moving your partner across the floor with grace.\n\n• The 
 “I Turn – You Turn”: A classic social dance staple that develops tim
 ing and hand-change coordination.\n\n• The Walk-Through: Learn how to tr
 ansition smoothly through the dance space without breaking your rhythm.\n\
 n• Footwork & Shine: We’ll break down the footwork pattern that adds p
 ersonality to your “shines.”\n\nTechnique & Artistry\n\n• Dancing is
  about more than just where your feet go. In this level\, we dive deeper i
 nto the “how”:\n\n• The Frame: Understand the “tension and compres
 sion” needed to lead and follow clearly without using muscle.\n\n• Upp
 er Body Mechanics: Learn how to isolate your ribcage and shoulders to move
  with that authentic Latin soul.\n\n• Connection: Developing a “heavy
 ” but responsive arm connection to ensure your partner feels every lead.
 \n\nImportant Details\n\n• No dance experience required: Whether you’v
 e never danced before or it’s been a while\, you’re welcome here!\n\n
 • No partner necessary: Come solo or bring a friend—either way\, you
 ’ll have plenty of opportunities to dance.\n\n• Please wear non-markin
 g shoe soles: This helps us keep our dance floor in great condition.\n\nDa
 te & Time:\n\nMonday 6:00 PM\n\nSaturday 11:00 AM\n\nInstructor: Lucie Ebn
 erova\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8 San Rafael\, CA \\(salsa lesso
 ns in Marin\\)\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor marking shoe so
 les allowed.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-beginners-2/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
