BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bongs + Books Silent Book Club at The Lounge at Mercy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T200000
UID:261014Uk8ZkVbbA0yCrGd6-g1ing
DESCRIPTION:Bongs \\+ Books is our monthly silent book club where we light
  up & swap small talk for story time. No assigned books\, no deadlines\, n
 o discussions or small talk — just a shared space to unwind\, light up\,
  and get lost in a good read.\n\nBring whatever you’re currently reading
  \\(or listening - we have coloring books and puzzles for our audiobook lo
 vers!\\)\, grab something to smoke\, and settle in for a cozy\, low-pressu
 re night of uninterrupted reading alongside fellow book lovers.\n\nCome so
 lo or with friends and enjoy comfy vibes\, good weed\, and a room full of 
 people happily minding their own business.\n\nHow it works:\n\n5-6pm: Arri
 ve\, get settled\, and kick things off with a short welcome sesh.\n\n6-7pm
 : heads-down reading time\, lo-fi music\, and chill energy.\n\n7-8pm: wrap
  up chapters\, meet other readers\, one last sesh to end the evening!
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://bookclubs.com/bongs-books-silent-book-club/about-our-club
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
