 and Stars\, where Sonoma County wine meets cosmic discovery. Guests can re
 lax with exceptional Chardonnay and Pinot Noir courtesy of Landmark Vineya
 rds while listening to engaging astronomy talks from observatory docents. 
 As night falls\, visitors will have the opportunity to observe planets\, s
 tar clusters\, and distant galaxies through the observatory's telescopes. 
