BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FLAMENCO! LIVE! Saturday\, November 14th at The Big Easy Petaluma 
 USA
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T164500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T200000
UID:2610189DG97-_0tkybqkWGt_Yr-Q
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an intoxicating evening of fiery flamenco performa
 nces when FLAMENCO! LIVE! sets the stage on fire with the fury and passion
  of Spain's legendary Gypsies \\(Roma\\) with a Flamenco Dinner Show in th
 e intimate atmosphere of THE BIG EASY. EXPERIENCE flamenco as stirring dan
 ces\, blazing guitars\, and soulful singing will transport you to another 
 place and time.\n\nThis month we are introducing to Sonoma County Dancers 
 Angela Arteritano and Devon LaRussa! We are excited to have them here for 
 the first time! Come and check it out for yourselves. FEEL the HEAT...\n\n
 FLAMENCO!\n\nLIVE!\n\nSaturday\, November 14th 2026\n\nRoberto Zamora ~ Si
 nger\n\nMark Taylor ~ Guitarist\n\nand introducing ~\n\nAngela Arteritano 
 ~ Dancer\n\nDevon LaRussa ~ Dancer\n\ny "La Fibi" Canta un poquito\n\nShow
 time: 6 pm\n\nDoors: 5 pm\n\nStill only $25\n\nPay at the Door Cash or Car
 d\n\nat\n\nThe Big Easy\n\nClub and Restaurant\n\n128 American Alley\n\nPe
 taluma USA\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*
 \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nFlamenco Shows every OTHER Mont
 h!\n\nThe 2nd Saturday of the Month.\n\nAlways different Artists.\n\nAlway
 s a different Show.\n\nFlamenco Dinner Show with delicious food and a Full
  Bar are available\, not included in entrance fee.\n\nArrive early\, get a
  good table and enjoy the food! Line forms at 4:45 pm\n\n\\*Limited Reserv
 ations available for parties of 5 - 6 or more.\n\nCall at: \\(707\\) 774- 
 9072\n\n\\*Large fully ventilated restaurant\, plenty of room for spacing\
 , masks optional.\n\nFLAMENCO! LIVE! was envisioned\, conceived\, and has 
 thrived since 2002 in Sonoma County\, California\, now celebrating 24 year
 s! Presenting the collaborative efforts of the Bay Area's finest Flamenco 
 Singers\, Guitarists and Dancers\, and supporting local Flamenco students\
 , dreamers\, and talents\, our goal has been to present top-notch performa
 nces. Phoebe Vernier "La Fibi" has brought decades of artistry and energy 
 to the public of Sonoma County for the purpose of sharing the music\, song
  and dance\, the treasure of Southern Spain. Whether in the formal theater
  or in a casual setting\, the respect\, purity\, and integrity of this tra
 ditional\, yet living and evolving art form is always foremost.\n\nNow in 
 our 25th Year of fiery Flamenco Shows in Sonoma County!\n\nThis performanc
 e is underwritten by the generous support of "The Circle of Sponsors"\, a 
 group of flamenco music\, song and dance Aficionados from Sonoma County\, 
 California and Nationwide that believe in the power of local art to heal a
 nd inspire our community and world. Thank you so much\, Sponsors!\n\n"Best
  Performing Dance Company" - The Northbay Bohemian's BEST of the Northbay!
LOCATION:The Big Easy Club and Restaurant
URL:https://flamencolive.weebly.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
