SUMMARY:Gradina - Balkan Music
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T210000
UID:260902Gfk9bBkgX0aTOKm1H6_zdQ
DESCRIPTION:Gradina is a Balkan music ensemble based in California's North
  Bay area. We celebrate the seasons and their festivals through song and d
 ance\, bringing Old World rituals to new light and new generations to reve
 l in the staying power of gratitude for life on Earth. We sing both a capp
 ella and with instrumental accompaniment. We lean toward traditional songs
  and arrangements. We present "sit-down" concerts for choral listening as 
 well as dance concerts\, and we are also available to teach most of the da
 nces we present. We are honored to play with many Balkan musicians from ne
 ar and far\, and every concert is different\, often with a different array
  of performers alongside the core group. Our special guests will be Gaelen
  Genetti on Bulgarian kaval and Christina Penrose on clarinet. Tickets are
  $20/$15 for OCA members. Doors open at 6:30 PM. Ticket sales begin Sept 1
 .
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.occidentalcenterforthearts.org/upcoming-events/gradina-bal
 kan-music
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
