DESCRIPTION:Benny La Mar is a singer-songwriter from San Francisco\, Calif
 ornia\, currently residing in Nashville\, Tennessee. He began learning pia
 no at a young age and quickly fell in love with music. This lead him to te
 ach himself to play guitar and begin writing his own original music. After
  actively performing around the San Francisco\, Bay Area\, Benny decided t
 o make the move to Nashville\, Tennessee in early 2022. Since moving to Na
 shville Benny has played over 200 shows and become an established performe
 r in the local music scene. He currently performs with his own project\, s
 howcasing his signature blend of catchy pop melodies and classic folk song
 writing. In addition to his solo work\, Benny is a sought-after multi-inst
 rumentalist\, collaborating with other artists and lending his skills on g
 uitar\, bass\, and keys. He also writes and produces music for other artis
 ts\, showcasing his versatility as musician and collaborator. With his str
 ong tenor voice\, thoughtful lyrics\, and infectious melodies\, Benny La M
 ar is a rising talent in the music industry\, poised to make a lasting imp
 act on the world of music.
LOCATION:JaM Cellars
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107953042?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
