DESCRIPTION:Set against the sweeping hills above Tomales Bay\, our outdoor
  yoga sessions offer a peaceful setting to move\, breathe\, and connect. A
 s morning light spreads across the water\, each class invites you to groun
 d yourself in stillness and balance\, surrounded by the natural rhythms of
  Point Reyes landscape.\n\nLed by experienced instructors from The Yoga Po
 st Petaluma. These sessions are designed for all levels and focuses on min
 dful movement with fresh air and open space\, encouraging balance and grou
 nding while improving overall health and wellness.\n\nClasses take place e
 very Saturday morning at 9:30am on Tower Hill\, weather permitting. Mats a
 re provided and participation is complimentary for overnight guest. The ge
 neral public is welcome to join for a small fee.
