 olenta\n\nWild Mushrooms and Aged Gouda Cheese\n\n2022 Paraduxx Rector Cre
 ek Cabernet - Zinfandel Blend\n\nSmoked Beef Short Rib\n\nBaby Root Vegeta
 ble Gremolata\n\n2023 Duckhorn Patzimaro Cabernet Sauvignon\n\n**SAVOR**\n
 \nPear Butter Cake\n\nGorgonzola Anglaise\, Spiced Pecans\, Caramel\n\nPai
 ring: 2021 Calera Viognier Doux\n\n\\- Please note this is a 21 and over e
