DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season at Grand Cru’s 2026 Holiday Open House 
 \\+ Marketplace! Join us Saturday\, November 21st for a festive afternoon 
 of wine\, shopping\, local food\, and community as we welcome our member w
 ineries\, local makers\, artisans\, and food vendors for a special holiday
  celebration.\n\nTaste your way through an exciting lineup of Grand Cru wi
 neries\, shop unique gifts from local makers and artisans\, enjoy deliciou
 s food and charcuterie\, and get a head start on your holiday shopping —
  all while supporting the incredible small businesses in our community.\n\
