UID:261003wm1qnnhWDU6cKWt8qV0WWA
DESCRIPTION:The Laugh Cellar presents: \n\nLos Angeles-based Don Friesen 
 is an award-winning headliner comedian known for his high-energy\, physica
 l\, and sharply relatable comedy. The only two-time winner in the 50-year 
 history of the San Francisco Comedy Competition\, Friesen has appeared on 
 Showtime\, Netflix\, Amazon Prime\, Comedy Central\, Dry Bar Comedy\, and 
 SiriusXM. Friesen blends observational comedy\, storytelling\, improvisati
 on\, and physicality into a style all his own. His latest special\, Break 
 a Leg\, finds Friesen older\, possibly wiser\, and—spoiler alert—not q
 uite as married as he used to be. Whether navigating technology\, relation
 ships\, or the absurdities of everyday life\, Friesen has a knack for turn
 ing real-life chaos into big laughs.\n\nIndoor Event - Balletto Vineyards 
 Reserve Room\n\nTheater style seating\n\nWine by the bottle and savory sna
 cks available for purchase. \n\n21\\+ \n\nDoors 6:00 PM
LOCATION:Balletto Vineyards
URL:https://www.crushersofcomedy.com/november212026.html
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
