DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Community Farmers' Market on Saturdays is an ab
 undant selection of the best Sonoma County and the surrounding region has 
 to offer. We are dedicated to championing local food\, agriculture\, and a
 rt. Our mission is to elevate local artisans\, farmers\, and producers whi
 le supporting the diverse communities that embrace them. Established in 19
 67 and currently managed by Agricultural Community Events Farmers' Market\
 , we hold ourselves to the exceptional high standard that comes with the r
 ole of every Certified California Farmers Market.
