DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261126T180000
UID:261019slgF6MEZkEaUd5eJWzhYPQ
DESCRIPTION:Thanksgiving at John Ash features a four-course holiday menu c
 elebrating seasonal flavors. The meal begins with farm greens tossed with 
 shaved fennel\, winter citrus\, pomegranate\, crispy wild rice and toasted
  pepitas\, followed by a choice of French onion soup topped with melted Gr
 uyère or roasted squash with spiced crème fraiche and crisp apple salad.
  For the main course\, guests can choose roasted turkey breast with guajil
 lo and orange\, stuffing bread pudding\, green beans\, mushroom cream\, cr
 anberry and rosemary jus\; miso black cod with celery root purée\, roaste
 d brassicas\, turnip and brown butter-Meyer lemon-parsley oil\; or squash 
 dirty rice with mushrooms\, country captain sauce\, fried sage\, scallions
  and toasted benne. The meal concludes with a seasonal "Apple Pie" dessert
  featuring warm spiced apples\, crumble\, whipped cream\, salted caramel a
 nd sorrel.
LOCATION:John Ash & Co.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/thanksgiving-at-john-ash-co/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
