 ensation. Tickets are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. Event detail
 s\, timing\, or programming are subject to change.\n\nCannabis consumption
  is limited to designated areas and must comply with all applicable local 
 and state regulations. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the venu
